# All found in the vendored `trivy` binary itself (see Dockerfile, runtime stage — ArtiFerris
# bundles Trivy to scan images pushed to it). Fixes exist upstream but aquasecurity hasn't cut
# a new Trivy release with the bumped dependencies yet, at v0.74.0 (latest as of 2026-09-09).
# Added 2026-09-09. Each entry expires on its own (exp:), which makes the scan fail again so somebody
# looks: bump Trivy if a release exists, otherwise push the date back.

